":"65973","senseId":"1","lemma":"아가씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날씬해서","meaning":"苗条，修长，颀长","explanation":"날씬하다：苗条，修长，颀长；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"날씬하다","audio":"/audio/fec6c5dc6d5202d1eaf9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40854","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씬하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작은","meaning":"小，瘦","explanation":"작다：小，瘦；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"작다","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69513","senseId":"2","lemma":"작다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이즈가","meaning":"尺寸，号，尺码","explanation":"사이즈：尺寸，号，尺码；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사이즈","audio":"/audio/e0511ad24076321c499a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61226","senseId":"1","lemma":"사이즈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어울리겠네요.","meaning":"谐调，相配，般配","explanation":"어울리다：谐调，相配，般配；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"어울리다","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67048","senseId":"4","lemma":"어울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"3c99ce3d4775969b","term":"아가씨","zh":"小姐","audio":"/audio/3c99ce3d4775969b8c09.mp3","entryId":"65973","definition":"未结婚的年轻女子。","pronunciation":["아가씨"]},{"id":"fec6c5dc6d5202d1","term":"날씬하다","zh":"苗条，修长，颀长","audio":"/audio/fec6c5dc6d5202d1eaf9.mp3","entryId":"40854","definition":"身材高挑，甚是好看。","pronunciation":["날씬하다"]},{"id":"bc42f85bf5be37c9","term":"작다","zh":"小，瘦","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3","entryId":"69513","definition":"因少于指定大小而不合尺寸。","pronunciation":["작ː따"]},{"id":"e0511ad24076321c","term":"사이즈","zh":"尺寸，号，尺码","audio":"/audio/e0511ad24076321c499a.mp3","entryId":"61226","definition":"衣服或鞋等的大小及号数。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e3eff4fbd4afe320","term":"어